## Why This Is Asked

Tests system-level thinking for 3D reconstruction under dynamic scenes and edge-runtime constraints, plus evaluation rigor.

## Key Concepts

- Dense 3D representation (TSDF) with dynamic masking
- Lightweight pose estimation and masked fusion
- Dynamic voxel confidence and decay for occlusions
- Edge latency targets and robust evaluation metrics

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudocode: update TSDF with dynamic masking
function updateVoxelTSDF(voxel, depth, pose, isDynamic) {
  if (isDynamic) return; // skip static updates for dynamic voxels until confirmed
  const sdf = projectDepthToVoxel(depth, pose, voxel.coord);
  voxel.tsdf = (voxel.tsdf * voxel.weight + sdf) / (voxel.weight + 1);
  voxel.weight += 1;
}
```

